IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-DISTILL-V4.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-LAYERS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HIGH-RANK           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 LOW-RANK            PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DISTILL-V4.
    IF NUM-LAYERS == 0 OR HIGH-RANK == 0 OR LOW-RANK == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 23800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-LAYERS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
